{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56684","headline":"兴文塔铭 · 无名氏","name":"兴文塔铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东西南北总铜山，万万千千弥亿千。\n钱坊日铸百万算，功匠千人若神仙。\n天宝三载置此塔，不朽不坏与天连。\n（见光绪元年刊刘荣等纂《广昌县志》卷十二。\n）（按：《兴文塔铭》石刻，正书，天宝三载建，在东岳行祠。\n署「渤海郡常选上柱国高澄书」。\n作者不祥。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}